        `the care is by a childcare provider approved in accordance with a scheme made under section 12(5) of the Tax Credits Act 2002 or under section 60 of the Government of Wales Act 2006` IS approved
        `the care is by a school on school premises, meaning premises that may be inspected as part of an inspection of the school` IS school
